OL,3,GNEWSADraft dark skies guidance drawn up
OL,4,Afor the Highlands
OL,5,
OL,6,FHighland Council has produced draft
OL,7,Fguidance aimed at reducing light
OL,8,Fpollution to give stargazers clearer
OL,9,Fviews of the night sky.
OL,11,FOfficials said other benefits of
OL,12,Fminimising outdoor lighting included
OL,13,Flower carbon emissions and energy
OL,14,Fcosts.
OL,16,FThe guidance would support communities
OL,17,Fwishing to set up dark sky sites, which
OL,18,Fare locations with little or no light
OL,19,Fpollution.
